// @check
// @error no method '.zorptastic' on string
// CONTRACT (must-error), and the NEGATIVE CONTROL for D1599: a name with no plausible
// neighbour — in the newcomer map or within an edit distance that scales with length —
// gets the bare `no method '.<prop>' on <type>` and no suggestion at all.
//
// A wrong guess is worse than none, so the suggester offers a name only from the newcomer
